  <p class="response-placeholder">[ Type your conceptual answer or explanation here... ]</p>
</div>
<div class="response-box">
  <p class="response-label">✍️ Student Response Area (Double-click to type)</p>
  <p class="response-placeholder">[ Type your conceptual answer or explanation here... ]</p>
</div>
<div class="question">3. (Short Response) What does it mean when we say "Technology is a multiplier"?</div>
<div class="response-box">
  <p class="response-label">✍️ Student Response Area (Double-click to type)</p>
  <p class="response-placeholder">[ Type your conceptual answer or explanation here... ]</p>
</div>
<div class="response-box">
  <p class="response-label">✍️ Student Response Area (Double-click to type)</p>
  <p class="response-placeholder">[ Type your conceptual answer or explanation here... ]</p>
</div>
<div class="question">4. (Teach-Back) Explain the Power Tool Principle to a younger student. Why does it matter *how* you use AI, not just whether you use it?</div>
<div class="response-box">
  <p class="response-label">✍️ Student Response Area (Double-click to type)</p>
  <p class="response-placeholder">[ Type your conceptual answer or explanation here... ]</p>
</div>
<div class="response-box">
  <p class="response-label">✍️ Student Response Area (Double-click to type)</p>
  <p class="response-placeholder">[ Type your conceptual answer or explanation here... ]</p>
</div>
