<h3>Part 4: Human Responsibility and the Highest Path</h3>
<div class="question">13. (Multiple Choice) Which of the following is one of the Highest Path Test questions?</div>
<ul>
<li><span class="checkbox">&#9744;</span> Does this save me the most time right now?</li>
<li><span class="checkbox">&#9744;</span> Does this make me stronger or weaker?</li>
<li><span class="checkbox">&#9744;</span> Does this sound like something a smart person would say?</li>
<li><span class="checkbox">&#9744;</span> How many people are doing this?</li>
</ul>
<div class="question">14. (Scenario) You are confused about a history topic. Option A: Copy an AI answer and move on. Option B: Ask AI to explain it simply, then quiz you. Which is the Highest Path, and why?</div>
<div class="response-box">
  <p class="response-label">✍️ Student Response Area (Double-click to type)</p>
