<h3>Part 5: Applied Ethics and Social Impact</h3>
<div class="question">17. (Multiple Choice) When applying the "Pause Before Share" rule, what should you ask yourself?</div>
<ul>
<li><span class="checkbox">&#9744;</span> Could this hurt someone if I'm wrong?</li>
<li><span class="checkbox">&#9744;</span> Is this going to go viral?</li>
<li><span class="checkbox">&#9744;</span> Did someone else post it first?</li>
<li><span class="checkbox">&#9744;</span> Is this funny enough to share immediately?</li>
</ul>
<div class="question">18. (Scenario) A classmate sends you an AI-generated image that looks real and makes fun of another student. What is the smartest action to take based on the Pause Before Share rule?</div>
